      en: ["Ibanda became the headquarters of its own district in 2005.", "The area was a notable center for gold mining during the 1930s.", "Ibanda University, established in 2014, is a major local institution.", "Coffee and dairy products are the primary economic drivers.", "The town is located along the highway connecting Mbarara and Kamwenge.", "Ibanda sits at an average elevation of about 1,400 meters."],
