      hu: ["Bugiri a kenyai határ (Malaba) felé vezető főút mentén fekszik.", "A város Uganda rizstermesztésének egyik legfontosabb központja.", "A Bugiri körzetet 1997-ben hozták létre az adminisztratív reform során.", "A Tilda Rice (korábban Kibimba) ültetvényei a város mellett találhatók.", "Fontos logisztikai állomás az Indiai-óceán felé tartó teherforgalomban.", "A terület tengerszint feletti magassága körülbelül 1100 méter."],
      ro: ["Bugiri este situat pe ruta principală spre frontiera cu Kenya, Malaba.", "Orașul este centrul celei mai mari zone de cultivare a orezului din Uganda.", "Districtul Bugiri a fost stabilit oficial în cursul anului 1997.", "Ferma de orez Tilda (fosta Kibimba) este un angajator major în zonă.", "Localitatea este un punct de oprire obligatoriu pentru traficul greu regional.", "Altitudinea medie a orașului Bugiri este de circa 1100 de metri."],
      en: ["Bugiri is located on the main highway to the Kenya-Uganda border.", "The town is a central hub for rice production within Uganda.", "Bugiri District was officially established in July 1997.", "The Tilda Rice Scheme, a major employer, is located nearby.", "It acts as a key transit point for goods moving to the Indian Ocean.", "Bugiri is situated at an elevation of approximately 1,100 meters."],
