      en: ["Located approximately 320 kilometers southwest of Kampala.", "Core area for Uganda's commercial tea production and processing.", "Home to the Ishaka-based campus of Kampala International University.", "Bushenyi District was originally part of the old Ankole District.", "A top national producer of highland bananas (matooke).", "The town's elevation is approximately 1,500 meters above sea level."],
